  "chain": "inadequate configuration controls at initial setup [cause D] -> erroneous digital detector parameters entered into database -> particulate/gaseous conversion factors out of tolerance (life of plant) -> RMS-RE112 declared inoperable, TS 3.4.7 Condition B entered (9 days) [backup: remaining RCS leakage detection instrumentation channels remained operable]",
